                                "sense_id": "cfe99471-2b7c-391e-b371-c5741d0b54bd",
                                "text": "1965, Thom Gunn, “Misanthropos” IX (retitled as “Memoirs of the World” in Poems 1950-1966: A Selection, London: Faber & Faber, 1969, p. 41,\n[…] I laboured\nto become a god of charm,\nan untirable giver."
